Iron Shulker Boxes 26.3 unofficial fix build
=============================================

This work is a modified version of "Iron Shulker Boxes" 26.3-1.0.0.

Original mod: Iron Shulker Boxes
  Author: Astryxion
  Contributor: ProgWML6
  Sources: https://github.com/astryxion/Iron-Shulkers
  License: GNU General Public License v3.0

Modifications made by zXav1er on 2026-11-06:

  1. Added com/astryxion/ironshulkerbox/RegistryBootstrapFix.java
     (new Fabric main entrypoint that initialises the mod's menu types early).
  2. Replaced fabric.mod.json entrypoints block to add the extra main
     entrypoint and the optional quickshulker / shulkerboxtooltip keys.
  3. Replaced the 102 files under data/ironshulkerbox/loot_table/blocks/
     so that the container copy uses the 26.3 "modifier" entry field.
  4. Rewrote com/astryxion/ironshulkerbox/common/item/IronShulkerBoxBlockItem.java
     (same class name and constructor, added client-side click prediction).
  5. Added com/astryxion/ironshulkerbox/compat/*.java
     (BoxContainer, InsertPrediction, QuickShulkerCompat, IronBoxPreviewProvider,
      SbtCompat, ScaledPreviewRenderer).
  6. Changed the superclass of AbstractIronShulkerBoxBlock from
     net.minecraft.world.level.block.BaseEntityBlock to
     net.minecraft.world.level.block.ShulkerBoxBlock (bytecode patch, see
     patches/tools/PatchSuper.java). No method bodies were changed by this patch.

